---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: collections.countries
  size: 1
  alias: c
permalink: "/scholarships/countries/{{ c.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Scholarships in {{ c.name }}"
  description: "Scholarships and opportunities in {{ c.name }}, with eligibility, required documents and official application links."
---
<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/scholarships/">Scholarships</a> / <a href="/scholarships/countries/">Countries</a></nav>
  <header class="page-head" style="padding-top:14px">
    <div class="label">Study in {{ c.name }}</div>
    <h1>Scholarships in {{ c.name }}</h1>
    {% if countryIntros[c.name] %}<p>{{ countryIntros[c.name] }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% set openC = c.items | stillOpen %}
    <p class="count">{{ c.items.length }} opportunit{% if c.items.length != 1 %}ies{% else %}y{% endif %} listed for {{ c.name }}{% if c.items.length > openC.length %} · {{ openC.length }} open now{% endif %}.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="grid">
    {% for item in c.items %}{% include "partials/card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  <section class="prose page-guide" style="margin-top:40px">
    <h2>Before you apply to study in {{ c.name }}</h2>
    <p>Each listing above explains who can apply, what the award covers and the deadline, with a link to the official website. Check three things before you start: whether your nationality is eligible, whether the scholarship covers living costs as well as tuition, and whether you must apply for admission and the scholarship separately.</p>
    <p>Need help with your documents? Read our <a href="/guides/">application guides</a> on CVs, motivation letters and research proposals.</p>
  </section>
</div>
